`get_db` her istekte yeni SQLite baglantisi acar `db.py:11-14`. FastAPI dependency zincirleri su sekildedir: `get_optional_user -> resolve_user -> _user_from_token` `auth.py:18-30`; `get_current_user -> resolve_user -> _user_from_token` `auth.py:23-26`; `require_customer -> get_current_user` `auth.py:33-36`; `require_restaurant -> get_current_user + restaurant sorgusu` `auth.py:39-48`; `require_courier -> get_current_user + courier sorgusu` `auth.py:51-60`.

