| `user` `schema.sql:13-19` | `id`, `email`, `password_hash`, `role`, `balance` | `POST /api/auth/register` yazar; `POST /api/auth/login` okur; `GET /api/auth/me` token uzerinden okur; `POST /api/auth/wallet/topup` yazar/okur; `POST /api/orders` bakiye okur/yazar; `GET /api/restaurants/{id}` yorumcu e-postasi icin JOIN eder; `POST /api/restaurant/couriers` kurye `user` yazar; `order_history`, `restaurant_orders`, `courier_orders` e-posta icin JOIN eder. |
| `auth_token` `schema.sql:21-25` | `token`, `user_id`, `created_at` | `POST /api/auth/register` ve `POST /api/auth/login` yazar; tum kimlikli endpointler `resolve_user` uzerinden okur. |
